                    "q": ". How to do revision in an effective manner (Total points 4 under this heading)",
                    "a": "1. Revision is about ensuring that what you have learnt is accessible. 2. Revision is about tidying up loose ends, putting the stuff you know in order. 3. Only go over stuff you know and organise it in your mind. 4. While revising, don't learn new material. It will only lie in the way and interfere with the material you know well."
