                "q": "4. In which quadrant does terminal side of angle θ lie if:\n(i) cosθ < 0 and sinθ > 0 (ii) tanθ > 0 and cosθ < 0 (iii) sinθ < 0 and secθ < 0 (iv) cotθ > 0 and secθ < 0 (v) cosθ < 0 and tanθ < 0 (vi) 0 < cotθ < 1"
