                "a": "Total workers = 120\nWomen = 45\nMen = 120 − 45 = 75\n(i) Men to women = 75 : 45 = 5 : 3\n(ii) Women to men = 45 : 75 = 3 : 5\n(iii) Women to total workers = 45 : 120 = 3 : 8\n(iv) Men to total workers = 75 : 120 = 5 : 8"
