                "a": "y ∝ x\ny = kx ... (i)\nx = 3\ny = 10\n10 = 3k\nk = [[10/3]]\n(i) y = ([[10/3]])x\n(ii) x = 6\ny = ([[10/3]])(6) = 20\n(iii) y = 15\n15 = ([[10/3]])x\nx = [[45/10]] = [[9/2]]"
