                "a": "y ∝ [[1/x]]\ny = [[k/x]] ... (i)\ny = 10\nx = 3\n10 = [[k/3]]\nk = 30\ny = [[30/x]] ... (ii)\nx = 10\ny = [[30/10]] = 3"
