                "a": "F ∝ [[1/d²]]\nF = [[k/d²]] ... (i)\nF = 2\nd = 3\n2 = [[k/(3)²]] = [[k/9]]\nk = 18\nF = [[18/d²]] ... (ii)\nF = 72\n72 = [[18/d²]]\nd² = [[18/72]] = [[1/4]]\nd = [[1/2]]"
