                "a": "(i) 100m and 500cm\n500cm = 5m\nRatio = 100m : 5m = 100 : 5 = 20 : 1\n(ii) 50kg and 300g\n50kg = 50000g\nRatio = 50000g : 300g = 50000 : 300 = 500 : 3"
