                "a": "mOA = mOB\nmAC = mBC\nmOC = mOC\n△OCA ≅ △OCB\nm∠OCA = m∠OCB\n∠OCA + ∠OCB = 180°\nm∠OCA = m∠OCB = 90°\nOC ⊥ AB",
