                    "q": "Match the column:\nA: (a) if (b) loop (c) Conditional expression (d) Loops and switch (e) do (f) >> (g) case\nB: (i) Relational operators (ii) break (iii) switch (iv) operator (v) iteration (vi) else (vii) while"
