                    "q": "A girl throws a small stone into a lake. Waves spread out from where the stone hits the water and travel to the bank of the lake. She notices that ten waves reach the side of the pond in a time of 5.0s. What is the frequency of the waves? (a) 0.50Hz (b) 15Hz (c) 2.0Hz (d) 50Hz"
