                    "a": "[[S]]Write down the known quantities:[[/S]][[E]]Speed of sound at 0°C = 331 m/s[[/E]][[E]]T = 50°C = 50 + 273 K = 323 K[[/E]][[S]]Write down the formula:[[/S]][[E]]v = 331 × √(T/273K)[[/E]][[S]]Put the values:[[/S]][[E]]v = 331 × √(323/273) = 331 × √1.183 = 331 × 1.088[[/E]][[S]]Calculate:[[/S]][[E]]v = 360.0 m/s[[/E]][[A]]The speed of sound in air at 50°C is 360.0 m/s.[[/A]]",
                    "q": "Calculate the speed of sound in air at 50°C? Given that speed of sound at 0°C is 331m/s. (360.0 ms^-1)"
