                    "a": "[[S]]Write down the known quantities:[[/S]][[E]]v = 340 m/s[[/E]][[E]]f1 = 20 Hz[[/E]][[E]]f2 = 20 kHz = 20,000 Hz[[/E]][[S]]Wavelength λ = v / f:[[/S]][[E]]λ1 = 340 / 20 = 17 m[[/E]][[E]]λ2 = 340 / 20,000 = 0.017 m[[/E]][[A]]The wavelengths are 17 m (for 20 Hz) and 0.017 m (for 20 kHz). (Note: the printed answers (17.2, 0.172 m) do not follow from the stated speed of 340 m/s; 17.2 m would need v = 344 m/s, and 0.172 m is ten times too large.)[[/A]]",
