                    "a": "[[S]]Write down the known quantities:[[/S]][[E]]λ = 15.0 μm = 15.0 × 10^-6 m[[/E]][[E]]c = 3 × 10^8 m/s[[/E]][[S]]Frequency f = c / λ:[[/S]][[E]]f = (3 × 10^8) / (15.0 × 10^-6) = 2 × 10^13 Hz[[/E]][[A]]The frequency of the infrared radiation is 2 × 10^13 Hz.[[/A]]",
