                    "a": "[[S]]Write down the known quantities:[[/S]][[E]]I = 0.0002 A[[/E]][[E]]t = 1 minute = 60 s[[/E]][[S]]Charge:[[/S]][[E]]Q = I × t[[/E]][[S]]Substitute the values:[[/S]][[E]]Q = 0.0002 × 60[[/E]][[S]]Calculate:[[/S]][[E]]Q = 0.012 C = 12 mC[[/E]][[A]]The charge that flows every minute is 12 mC. [[/A]]",
