                    "a": "The field is provided by two oppositely charged metal plates; the force acting on the electron is constant and towards the positive plate, so the beam follows a parabolic (curved) path towards the positive plate. The motion of an electron in an electric field is like the motion of a projectile in a gravitational field.",
