                    "q": "b) Uranium-238 nuclide decays to form a thorium nuclide (symbol Th) by emission of an alpha particle. State i. The proton number of an alpha particle, ii. The nucleon number of an alpha particle, iii. The proton number of thorium iv. The nucleon number of thorium isotopes formed."
