                    "a": "“Allah will raise the believers among you, and those given knowledge, to high ranks.” (Surah Al-Mujadilah: 58,11). Translation: Allah will raise the believers among you, and those given knowledge, to high ranks. Also: “And Allah the Supreme taught Adam all the names (of things)”. (Surah Al-Baqarah: 31).",
                    "q": "Quote a verse along with a translation on the importance of knowledge."
