                    "q": "A portion of the Vernier scale is shown in Fig (1.26). What will be the reading on the Vernier scale? (a) 6.50 cm (b) 6.55 cm (c) 7.00 cm (d) 7.45 cm",
                    "a": "(b) 6.55 cm ✓ — The main scale reading is 6.5 cm and the 5th line of the Vernier scale coincides with the main scale, so the Vernier reading is 5 × 0.01 = 0.05 cm. Total reading = 6.5 + 0.05 = 6.55 cm."
