                    "a": "(i) (b) Record time for 10 oscillations and divide by 10 ✓ — measuring the time for many oscillations reduces the human reaction error. (ii) A digital stopwatch or a light gate should be used for a more accurate measurement of the time period, because a digital stopwatch measures up to 0.01 second and a light gate has no human reaction error."
