                    "a": "[[S]]Write down the given quantities:[[/S]][[E]]Length (l) = Radius (r) = 2 m[[/E]][[S]](a) Find the volume of the sphere:[[/S]][[E]]V = [[4/3]] π r^3 = [[4/3]] × 3.14 × (2)^3 = 33.49 m^3[[/E]][[S]](b) Find the volume of the cube:[[/S]][[E]]V = l^3 = (2)^3 = 8 m^3[[/E]][[S]](c) Find the volume of the cylinder:[[/S]][[E]]V = π r^2 l = 3.14 × (2)^2 × 2 = 25.12 m^3[[/E]][[S]](d) Find the volume of the pyramid (square base 2 m × 2 m and height 2 m):[[/S]][[E]]V = [[1/3]] × area of base × height = [[1/3]] × 4 × 2 = 2.67 m^3[[/E]][[A]]The volume of the sphere is 33.49 m^3, of the cube 8 m^3, of the cylinder 25.12 m^3 and of the pyramid 2.67 m^3.[[/A]]"
