                    "q": "A body of mass 1kg is lifted through a height of 1m. The energy possessed in the body will be__________. (consider g =10ms^-2) (a) 1J (b) 10 Joule (c) 100 Joule (d) 1000 Joule",
                    "a": "(b) 10 Joule ✓ — P.E = mgh = 1 × 10 × 1 = 10 J."
