                "q": "Find any two proper subsets and one improper subset of:\n(i) X = {2, 4}  (ii) Y = Set of prime numbers less than 4",
                "a": "(i) Proper subsets: {2}, {4}\nImproper subset: {2, 4}\n(ii) Y = {2, 3}\nProper subsets: {2}, {3}\nImproper subset: {2, 3}"
