                "a": "1.\n1101_2 = 1 × 2^3 + 1 × 2^2 + 0 × 2^1 + 1 × 2^0\n= 1 × 8 + 1 × 4 + 0 × 2 + 1 × 1\n= 8 + 4 + 0 + 1 = 13\n2.\n11011_2 = 1 × 2^4 + 1 × 2^3 + 0 × 2^2 + 1 × 2^1 + 1 × 2^0\n= 1 × 16 + 1 × 8 + 0 × 4 + 1 × 2 + 1 × 1\n= 16 + 8 + 0 + 2 + 1 = 27\n3.\n10111_2 = 1 × 2^4 + 0 × 2^3 + 1 × 2^2 + 1 × 2^1 + 1 × 2^0\n= 1 × 16 + 0 × 8 + 1 × 4 + 1 × 2 + 1 × 1\n= 16 + 0 + 4 + 2 + 1 = 23\n4.\n110101_2 = 1 × 2^5 + 1 × 2^4 + 0 × 2^3 + 1 × 2^2 + 0 × 2^1 + 1 × 2^0\n= 1 × 32 + 1 × 16 + 0 × 8 + 1 × 4 + 0 × 2 + 1 × 1\n= 32 + 16 + 0 + 4 + 0 + 1 = 53\n5.\n101011_2 = 1 × 2^5 + 0 × 2^4 + 1 × 2^3 + 0 × 2^2 + 1 × 2^1 + 1 × 2^0\n= 1 × 32 + 0 × 16 + 1 × 8 + 0 × 4 + 1 × 2 + 1 × 1\n= 32 + 0 + 8 + 0 + 2 + 1 = 43\n6.\n1110111_2 = 1 × 2^6 + 1 × 2^5 + 1 × 2^4 + 0 × 2^3 + 1 × 2^2 + 1 × 2^1 + 1 × 2^0\n= 1 × 64 + 1 × 32 + 1 × 16 + 0 × 8 + 1 × 4 + 1 × 2 + 1 × 1\n= 64 + 32 + 16 + 0 + 4 + 2 + 1 = 119\n7.\n1100110_2 = 1 × 2^6 + 1 × 2^5 + 0 × 2^4 + 0 × 2^3 + 1 × 2^2 + 1 × 2^1 + 0 × 2^0\n= 1 × 64 + 1 × 32 + 0 × 16 + 0 × 8 + 1 × 4 + 1 × 2 + 0 × 1\n= 64 + 32 + 0 + 0 + 4 + 2 + 0 = 102\n8.\n1100111_2 = 1 × 2^6 + 1 × 2^5 + 0 × 2^4 + 0 × 2^3 + 1 × 2^2 + 1 × 2^1 + 1 × 2^0\n= 1 × 64 + 1 × 32 + 0 × 16 + 0 × 8 + 1 × 4 + 1 × 2 + 1 × 1\n= 64 + 32 + 0 + 0 + 4 + 2 + 1 = 103\n9.\n11010110_2 = 1 × 2^7 + 1 × 2^6 + 0 × 2^5 + 1 × 2^4 + 0 × 2^3 + 1 × 2^2 + 1 × 2^1 + 0 × 2^0\n= 1 × 128 + 1 × 64 + 0 × 32 + 1 × 16 + 0 × 8 + 1 × 4 + 1 × 2 + 0 × 1\n= 128 + 64 + 0 + 16 + 0 + 4 + 2 + 0 = 214\n10.\n11111101_2 = 1 × 2^7 + 1 × 2^6 + 1 × 2^5 + 1 × 2^4 + 1 × 2^3 + 1 × 2^2 + 0 × 2^1 + 1 × 2^0\n= 1 × 128 + 1 × 64 + 1 × 32 + 1 × 16 + 1 × 8 + 1 × 4 + 0 × 2 + 1 × 1\n= 128 + 64 + 32 + 16 + 8 + 4 + 0 + 1 = 253\n11.\n10010010_2 = 1 × 2^7 + 0 × 2^6 + 0 × 2^5 + 1 × 2^4 + 0 × 2^3 + 0 × 2^2 + 1 × 2^1 + 0 × 2^0\n= 1 × 128 + 0 × 64 + 0 × 32 + 1 × 16 + 0 × 8 + 0 × 4 + 1 × 2 + 0 × 1\n= 128 + 0 + 0 + 16 + 0 + 0 + 2 + 0 = 146\n12.\n11000101_2 = 1 × 2^7 + 1 × 2^6 + 0 × 2^5 + 0 × 2^4 + 0 × 2^3 + 1 × 2^2 + 0 × 2^1 + 1 × 2^0\n= 1 × 128 + 1 × 64 + 0 × 32 + 0 × 16 + 0 × 8 + 1 × 4 + 0 × 2 + 1 × 1\n= 128 + 64 + 0 + 0 + 0 + 4 + 0 + 1 = 197"
