                "a": "1.\n21_5 = 2 × 5^1 + 1 × 5^0\n= 2 × 5 + 1 × 1\n= 10 + 1 = 11\n2.\n30_5 = 3 × 5^1 + 0 × 5^0\n= 3 × 5 + 0 × 1\n= 15 + 0 = 15\n3.\n40_5 = 4 × 5^1 + 0 × 5^0\n= 4 × 5 + 0 × 1\n= 20 + 0 = 20\n4.\n12_5 = 1 × 5^1 + 2 × 5^0\n= 1 × 5 + 2 × 1\n= 5 + 2 = 7\n5.\n22_5 = 2 × 5^1 + 2 × 5^0\n= 2 × 5 + 2 × 1\n= 10 + 2 = 12\n6.\n131_5 = 1 × 5^2 + 3 × 5^1 + 1 × 5^0\n= 1 × 25 + 3 × 5 + 1 × 1\n= 25 + 15 + 1 = 41\n7.\n442_5 = 4 × 5^2 + 4 × 5^1 + 2 × 5^0\n= 4 × 25 + 4 × 5 + 2 × 1\n= 100 + 20 + 2 = 122\n8.\n232_5 = 2 × 5^2 + 3 × 5^1 + 2 × 5^0\n= 2 × 25 + 3 × 5 + 2 × 1\n= 50 + 15 + 2 = 67\n9.\n401_5 = 4 × 5^2 + 0 × 5^1 + 1 × 5^0\n= 4 × 25 + 0 × 5 + 1 × 1\n= 100 + 0 + 1 = 101\n10.\n430_5 = 4 × 5^2 + 3 × 5^1 + 0 × 5^0\n= 4 × 25 + 3 × 5 + 0 × 1\n= 100 + 15 + 0 = 115\n11.\n1310_5 = 1 × 5^3 + 3 × 5^2 + 1 × 5^1 + 0 × 5^0\n= 1 × 125 + 3 × 25 + 1 × 5 + 0 × 1\n= 125 + 75 + 5 + 0 = 205\n12.\n4421_5 = 4 × 5^3 + 4 × 5^2 + 2 × 5^1 + 1 × 5^0\n= 4 × 125 + 4 × 25 + 2 × 5 + 1 × 1\n= 500 + 100 + 10 + 1 = 611\n13.\n2322_5 = 2 × 5^3 + 3 × 5^2 + 2 × 5^1 + 2 × 5^0\n= 2 × 125 + 3 × 25 + 2 × 5 + 2 × 1\n= 250 + 75 + 10 + 2 = 337\n14.\n4013_5 = 4 × 5^3 + 0 × 5^2 + 1 × 5^1 + 3 × 5^0\n= 4 × 125 + 0 × 25 + 1 × 5 + 3 × 1\n= 500 + 0 + 5 + 3 = 508\n15.\n4304_5 = 4 × 5^3 + 3 × 5^2 + 0 × 5^1 + 4 × 5^0\n= 4 × 125 + 3 × 25 + 0 × 5 + 4 × 1\n= 500 + 75 + 0 + 4 = 579"
