                "a": "123_5 = 1 × 5^2 + 2 × 5^1 + 3 × 5^0\n= 1 × 25 + 2 × 5 + 3 × 1\n= 25 + 10 + 3 = 38\n11011_2 = 1 × 2^4 + 1 × 2^3 + 0 × 2^2 + 1 × 2^1 + 1 × 2^0\n= 1 × 16 + 1 × 8 + 0 × 4 + 1 × 2 + 1 × 1\n= 16 + 8 + 0 + 2 + 1 = 27\n2145_8 = 2 × 8^3 + 1 × 8^2 + 4 × 8^1 + 5 × 8^0\n= 2 × 512 + 1 × 64 + 4 × 8 + 5 × 1\n= 1024 + 64 + 32 + 5 = 1125\n29 × 2145_8 = 29 × 1125 = 32625\n123_5 × 11011_2 = 38 × 27 = 1026\n32625 - 1026 = 31599\n2 | 31599\n2 | 15799 - 1\n2 | 7899 - 1\n2 | 3949 - 1\n2 | 1974 - 1\n2 | 987 - 0\n2 | 493 - 1\n2 | 246 - 1\n2 | 123 - 0\n2 | 61 - 1\n2 | 30 - 1\n2 | 15 - 0\n2 | 7 - 1\n2 | 3 - 1\n| 1 - 1\n31599 = 111101101101111_2\n5 | 31599\n5 | 6319 - 4\n5 | 1263 - 4\n5 | 252 - 3\n5 | 50 - 2\n5 | 10 - 0\n| 2 - 0\n31599 = 2002344_5\n8 | 31599\n8 | 3949 - 7\n8 | 493 - 5\n8 | 61 - 5\n| 7 - 5\n31599 = 75557_8"
