                "a": "(i)\nProfit = S.P. − C.P. = 1,155 − 1,050 = Rs 105\nProfit % = [[Profit/C.P.]] × 100\n= [[105/1,050]] × 100\n= 10%\n(ii)\nS.P. = C.P. + Profit = 1,665 + 333 = Rs 1,998\nProfit % = [[333/1,665]] × 100\n= 20%\n(iii)\nProfit = 22% of C.P. = [[22/100]] × 6,000 = Rs 1,320\nS.P. = C.P. + Profit = 6,000 + 1,320 = Rs 7,320\n(iv)\nS.P. = 1,250, Profit % = 25%\nC.P. = 1,250 ÷ 1.25 = Rs 1,000\nProfit = S.P. − C.P. = 1,250 − 1,000 = Rs 250"
