                "q": "Indicate the degree of the following polynomials.\n(i) 5^3 (ii) x (iii) x + y^2 (iv) x^2 y^2 + y^2 (v) x^3 y^2 z^2 + 1 (vi) -[[1/4]] + 3x + 5 (vii) x^4 y + y^2 + y^3 (viii) 3^2 xyz (ix) x^6 + x^2 y^3 + xy^4 (x) -x^3 + 8xyz^2 (xi) [[2/13]] (xii) 4^2",
                "a": "(i) 5^3\n0\n(ii) x\n1\n(iii) x + y^2\nx: 1\ny^2: 2\n2\n(iv) x^2 y^2 + y^2\nx^2 y^2: 2 + 2 = 4\ny^2: 2\n4\n(v) x^3 y^2 z^2 + 1\nx^3 y^2 z^2: 3 + 2 + 2 = 7\n1: 0\n7\n(vi) -[[1/4]] + 3x + 5\n-[[1/4]]: 0\n3x: 1\n5: 0\n1\n(vii) x^4 y + y^2 + y^3\nx^4 y: 4 + 1 = 5\ny^2: 2\ny^3: 3\n5\n(viii) 3^2 xyz\nxyz: 1 + 1 + 1 = 3\n3\n(ix) x^6 + x^2 y^3 + xy^4\nx^6: 6\nx^2 y^3: 2 + 3 = 5\nxy^4: 1 + 4 = 5\n6\n(x) -x^3 + 8xyz^2\n-x^3: 3\n8xyz^2: 1 + 1 + 2 = 4\n4\n(xi) [[2/13]]\n0\n(xii) 4^2\n0"
