                "a": "(i) (Hyp)^2 = (mLN)^2 = 15^2 = 225 cm^2\n(Perp)^2 = (mLM)^2 = 9^2 = 81 cm^2\n(Base)^2 = (mMN)^2 = 12^2 = 144 cm^2\n225 = 81 + 144\n15^2 = 9^2 + 12^2\n(Hyp)^2 = (Perp)^2 + (Base)^2\n(ii) (Hyp)^2 = (mPR)^2 = 20^2 = 400 cm^2\n(Perp)^2 = (mPQ)^2 = 16^2 = 256 cm^2\n(Base)^2 = (mQR)^2 = 12^2 = 144 cm^2\n400 = 256 + 144\n20^2 = 16^2 + 12^2\n(Hyp)^2 = (Perp)^2 + (Base)^2\n(iii) (Hyp)^2 = (mXZ)^2 = 25^2 = 625 cm^2\n(Perp)^2 = (mXY)^2 = 15^2 = 225 cm^2\n(Base)^2 = (mYZ)^2 = 20^2 = 400 cm^2\n625 = 225 + 400\n25^2 = 15^2 + 20^2\n(Hyp)^2 = (Perp)^2 + (Base)^2"
