                "q": "3. x^2 + [[1/x^2]] ۽ x^4 + [[1/x^4]] جو ملهه لھو جڏهن:\n(i) x + [[1/x]] = 5",
                "a": "x + [[1/x]] = 5\n(x + [[1/x]])^2 = (5)^2\nx^2 + 2(x)([[1/x]]) + [[1/x^2]] = 25\nx^2 + 2 + [[1/x^2]] = 25\nx^2 + [[1/x^2]] = 25 - 2 = 23\n(x^2 + [[1/x^2]])^2 = (23)^2\nx^4 + 2(x^2)([[1/x^2]]) + [[1/x^4]] = 529\nx^4 + 2 + [[1/x^4]] = 529\nx^4 + [[1/x^4]] = 529 - 2 = 527"
