                "a": "13x - 9y = 1 ... (i)\n11x - 12y = 14 ... (ii)\nx = [[1 + 9y/13]] ... (i)\n11([[1 + 9y/13]]) - 12y = 14\n11 + 99y - 156y = 182\n-57y = 171\ny = -3\nx = [[1 + 9(-3)/13]] = -2\n{(-2, -3)}"
