                "a": "7x - 4y = 1 ... (i)\n2x - 5y = 8 ... (ii)\nx = [[1 + 4y/7]] ... (i)\n2([[1 + 4y/7]]) - 5y = 8\n2 + 8y - 35y = 56\n-27y = 54\ny = -2\nx = [[1 + 4(-2)/7]] = -1\n{(-1, -2)}"
