                "a": "x + y = 1 ... (i)\n3x + 6y = 5 ... (ii)\nx = 1 - y ... (i)\n3(1 - y) + 6y = 5\n3 - 3y + 6y = 5\n3y = 2\ny = [[2/3]]\nx = 1 - [[2/3]] = [[1/3]]\n{([[1/3]], [[2/3]])}"
