                "a": "3x - 7y = 1 ... (i)\n4x + y = 22 ... (ii)\ny = 22 - 4x ... (ii)\n3x - 7(22 - 4x) = 1\n3x - 154 + 28x = 1\n31x = 155\nx = 5\ny = 22 - 4(5) = 2\n{(5, 2)}"
