                "a": "2x + y - 10 = 0 ... (i)\nx + 3y - 8 = 0 ... (ii)\n[[x/(1 × (-8) - 3 × (-10))]] = [[y/((-10) × 1 - (-8) × 2)]] = [[1/(2 × 3 - 1 × 1)]]\n[[x/22]] = [[y/6]] = [[1/5]]\nx = [[22/5]] = 4 [[2/5]]\ny = [[6/5]] = 1 [[1/5]]\n{(4 [[2/5]], 1 [[1/5]])}"
