                "a": "x - 4y - 2 = 0 ... (i)\n2x - 7y - 5 = 0 ... (ii)\n[[x/((-4) × (-5) - (-7) × (-2))]] = [[y/((-2) × 2 - (-5) × 1)]] = [[1/(1 × (-7) - 2 × (-4))]]\n[[x/6]] = [[y/1]] = [[1/1]]\nx = 6\ny = 1\n{(6, 1)}"
