                "a": "13x − y − 14 = 0 ... (i)\n2x + 7y − 9 = 0 ... (ii)\n[[x/((−1) × (−9) − (7) × (−14))]] = [[y/((−14) × 2 − (−9) × 13)]] = [[1/(13 × 7 − 2 × (−1))]]\n[[x/107]] = [[y/89]] = [[1/93]]\nx = [[107/93]]\ny = [[89/93]]\n{([[107/93]], [[89/93]])}"
