                "a": "2x + y = 7 ... (i)\nx + 3y = 4 ... (ii)\nx = 4 - 3y ... (ii)\n2(4 - 3y) + y = 7\n8 - 6y + y = 7\n8 - 5y = 7\n5y - 1 = 0"
