                "a": "x^2 + y = 0 ... (i)\nax + b = 0 ... (ii)\nx = -[[b/a]] ... (ii)\n(-[[b/a]])^2 + y = 0\n[[b^2/a^2]] + y = 0\nb^2 + a^2y = 0"
