                "a": "(i) Cos x = [[√3/2]]\nCos 30° = [[√3/2]]\nCos x = Cos 30°\nx = 30°\n(ii) Cos x = [[1/√2]]\nCos 45° = [[1/√2]]\nCos x = Cos 45°\nx = 45°\n(iii) Cos x = [[1/2]]\nCos 60° = [[1/2]]\nCos x = Cos 60°\nx = 60°"
