                "a": "(i) 2 Sin 45° + [[1/2]] Cosec 45°\n= 2 × [[1/√2]] + [[1/2]] × √2\n= [[2/√2]] + [[√2/2]]\n= [[2√2/2]] + [[√2/2]]\n= √2 + [[√2/2]]\n= [[2√2/2]] + [[√2/2]]\n= [[3√2/2]]\n= [[6/(2√2)]]\n= [[3/√2]]\n(ii) Cos 60° × Cos 30° − Sin 60° × Sin 30°\n= [[1/2]] × [[√3/2]] − [[√3/2]] × [[1/2]]\n= [[√3/4]] − [[√3/4]]\n= 0\n(iii) Sin 60° Cos 30° − Cos 60° Sin 30°\n= [[√3/2]] × [[√3/2]] − [[1/2]] × [[1/2]]\n= [[3/4]] − [[1/4]]\n= [[2/4]]\n= [[1/2]]\n(iv) (Cos 30° − Sin 30°) × (Cos 30° + Sin 30°)\n= Cos^2 30° − Sin^2 30°\n= ([[√3/2]])^2 − ([[1/2]])^2\n= [[3/4]] − [[1/4]]\n= [[2/4]]\n= [[1/2]]\n(v) Sin 45° × Cos 45° + Sin 30° × Cos 60°\n= [[1/√2]] × [[1/√2]] + [[1/2]] × [[1/2]]\n= [[1/2]] + [[1/4]]\n= [[2/4]] + [[1/4]]\n= [[3/4]]"
