                    "a": "[[E]]Force = Pressure × Area = P × A[[/E]][[S]]Pressure = P = 101200 Pa[[/S]][[S]]Area = A = 0.006 m^2[[/S]][[S]]F = 101200 × 0.006 = 607.2[[/S]][[A]]F = 607 N[[/A]]"
