                    "a": "[[E]]Pressure = Force/Area = F/A[[/E]][[S]]Force = F = 46 N[[/S]][[S]]Area = A = 0.5 m^2[[/S]][[S]]P = 46/0.5[[/S]][[A]]P = 92 N/m^2[[/A]]"
