                    "q": "Q5. Write similarities and differences of convex and concave lenses in the given Venn diagram.",
                    "a": "[[T]]Convex Lens|Similarities|Concave Lens;;Thicker in the middle than at the edges|Both are made of transparent glass and work by refraction|Thinner in the middle than at the edges;;Converges light rays to a focal point|Both have an optical centre, principal axis, focal point and focal length|Diverges light rays;;Can form a real image on a screen|Both are used in optical instruments|Always forms a virtual image;;Focal length is taken as positive|—|Focal length is taken as negative[[/T]]"
