                    "a": "Energy in the wind (kinetic energy of the wind) → Energy in the moving rotor blades (kinetic/mechanical energy) → Output energy from the turbine (electrical energy). The wind rotates the blades of the fan of the wind energy system; the axle of the fan therefore rotates the generator to produce electricity."
