              {
                "label": "9",
                "items": [
                  {
                    "q": "Q9. What are the advantages of a Solar Power Plant?",
                    "a": "Solar energy is free and available everywhere; it needs no fuel; it causes no pollution; solar cells convert sunlight directly into electrical energy; electricity can be provided even in remote areas; and batteries can be charged to use electricity at night as well. In Pakistan, the Quaid-e-Azam Solar Power Plant has been installed. Solar panels do not pollute the air and environment, and solar panel installations in schools are becoming more popular as they decrease the environmental impact of these institutions."
                  }
                ]
              }
