                "q": "Simplify:\n(i) [[9/7]] + [[15/7]]   (ii) [[5/9]] − [[2/9]]   (iii) [[3/5]] − (−[[7/5]])\n(iv) [[5/6]] + [[2/6]] − [[1/6]]   (v) [[5/8]] − [[4/5]]   (vi) −[[2/7]] + [[7/6]]\n(vii) [[2/3]] + [[5/7]] − [[1/6]]   (viii) [[4/5]] − [[1/7]] + [[3/70]]   (ix) [[2/9]] − (−[[3/6]]) + [[5/8]]\n(x) [[17/10]] + [[11/20]] − [[4/5]]"
