                "q": "6. Find the value of x.\n(i) 25^x = 125\n(ii) ([[2/3]])^x × ([[2/3]])^4 = ([[2/3]])^10 ÷ ([[2/3]])^2\n(iii) {([[2/7]])^x}^5 = ([[2/7]])^10"
