                    "a": "Rule of law means that there is nothing above the law — the law applies equally to all. The constitution of Pakistan declares all citizens equal before the law and every citizen is entitled to equal protection of law. Rule of law protects the fundamental rights of citizens: equality of status, equal opportunity to access law, social, economic and political justice, and freedom of thought and expression, belief, faith, worship and association within the limits of law and public morality.",
