                    "q": "Ask five children that how they would spend their pocket money if the price of their favourite food (or drink) which they buy every day suddenly increased? Ask them to tell you that what they would do if the price of the item of their choice suddenly goes down. Then, write a small paragraph to describe their reactions to a change in price."
