                    "a": "The four requisites of the belief in Prophethood are: (1) Love for the Holy Prophet — to express utmost love towards him; (2) Respect and Reverence — to respect them with heart and soul; (3) Help and Support — to support him in his holy mission, in the propagation of Islam, preaching and raising the Word of Allah Almighty; (4) Obedience — to make them role models and practise wholeheartedly whatever the Holy Prophet taught us.",
                    "q": "4. What are the requisites of the Prophethood?"
