                "a": "[[a/b]] − [[b/c]] + [[c/a]] − [[a/c]]\n= [[−3/5]] − [[5/−2]] + [[−2/−3]] − [[−3/−2]]\n= −[[3/5]] + [[5/2]] + [[2/3]] − [[3/2]]\n= −[[3/5]] + 1 + [[2/3]]\n= [[16/15]]",
